        <li><a href="#income-tax-brackets-2026-table" class="text-link hover:underline">2. Official Malaysia Tax Rates & Brackets Table 2026</a></li>
        <li><a href="#gross-vs-chargeable-income" class="text-link hover:underline">3. Calculating Gross Income vs Chargeable Income</a></li>
        <li><a href="#minimum-salary-tax-threshold" class="text-link hover:underline">4. Minimum Salary Threshold & Tax Free Allowance</a></li>
